      "text": "SUMMARY\nJane Doe is a Frontend Lead based in Dublin, Ireland with 10 years of experience across Financial Technology, Cloud\nSoftware, and Digital Media. She holds a bachelor degree in Computer Science from Trinity College Dublin and\nspecializes in JavaScript, TypeScript, React, Vue.js, Redux, HTML5/CSS3, Webpack, and Jest. Her background includes\nleadership experience guiding frontend teams and mentoring junior developers."
