      "text": "EXPERIENCE\nFrontend Lead — Emerald Paytech Mar 2021 – Present\nIndustry: Financial Technology\n• Led frontend development using JavaScript, TypeScript, React, Redux, and Jest.\n• Guided technical vision and mentored junior developers within Financial Technology.\nSenior Frontend Engineer — Celtic Cloud Systems Jan 2018 – Feb 2021\nIndustry: Cloud Software\n• Built interactive monitoring dashboards using TypeScript, Vue.js, Webpack, and HTML5/CSS3.\n• Engineered web interface components for Cloud Software platforms.\nFrontend Developer — Liffey Media Mar 2016 – Dec 2017\nIndustry: Digital Media\n• Developed user interfaces for web applications utilizing JavaScript, HTML5/CSS3, and Webpack.\n• Created modern responsive layouts in the Digital Media sector."
